---
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>About | Christ Sword</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: Georgia, serif; background: #1a1a2e; color: #f0e6d2; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; }
      .container { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 2rem 1.5rem; }
      h1 { color: #c5a059; border-bottom: 2px solid #c5a059; padding-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; }
      p { margin-bottom: 1.25rem; }
      .verse { font-style: italic; color: #c5a059; border-left: 3px solid #c5a059; padding-left: 1rem; margin: 2rem 0; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <Header title="Christ Sword" />
    <main>
      <div class="container">
        <h1>About Christ Sword</h1>
        <p>Christ Sword is a Christian watchdog ministry standing for truth, praying for the persecuted, and contending for the faith once delivered to the saints.</p>
        <p>Our name comes from Scripture: the Word of God is "sharper than any double-edged sword" (Hebrews 4:12), and we are called to "contend for the faith" (Jude 1:3).</p>
        <div class="verse">"Finally, be strong in the Lord and in his mighty power. Put on the full armor of God." — Ephesians 6:10–11</div>
      </div>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
